### Check first
Open [this component](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/highlights) and its [metrics](/#/components/{{componentUrnForUrl}}/metrics). Check the API pod readiness, Service endpoints and Collector scrape errors. The configured threshold is **{{threshold}}** in the monitor chart's unit.

### Likely causes
API restart, incorrect scrape endpoint or a network policy blocking access.

### Fix
Restore the API endpoint and its scrape path without resetting pipeline metadata.

### Verify
The next observed scrape reports up=1. If samples are absent, investigate the exporter and Collector: this threshold check cannot establish healthy operation without data.
